  "description": {
    "text": "Twelve oversized cards packed in sealed booster boxes of the three e-Card Series expansions, a reward for buying the whole box. They are numbered 01/12 to 12/12: Alakazam, Feraligatr, Tyranitar and Venusaur came in Expedition Base Set boxes, from 15 September 2002; Entei, Espeon, Scizor and Suicune in Aquapolis boxes; and Charizard, Crobat, Ho-Oh and Kabutops in Skyridge boxes, from 12 May 2003. Skyridge was the last expansion Wizards of the Coast made before it lost the license.\n\nBox Toppers began with four oversized reverse holo cards in Legendary Collection. From EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua they became regular-sized cards with a design of their own, until EX Holon Phantoms, and they came back nearly 20 years later in the Enhanced Booster Display Boxes of Journey Together."
  },
